<title>UK: BT Effecten sets warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>BT Effecten sets warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued 300,000</p>
<p>European-style HI-LO warrants, on the U.S. dollar/mark exchange</p>
<p>rate, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   12.DEC.96	  SPOT REFERENCE  $1.5250</p>
<p>LISTING  DUSS, FFURT, STUTTGART, BERLIN, HAMBURG</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p>TYPE	  MATURITY	     PRICE</p>
<p> HI-LO 1     25.JUN.97	    2.75 DEM</p>
<p> HI-LO 2     25.SEP.97	    2.45 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	 PAYOFF IS LINKED TO A COMPLICATED FORMULA.</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
